// Signing. Set DEVELOPMENT_TEAM to the 10-character Team ID of CODESHARE
// TECHNOLOGY LTD's Apple Developer account (developer.apple.com → Account →
// Membership details), here or in Signing.local.xcconfig (not committed).
// Xcode then makes and renews the certificates and profiles itself
// (automatic signing). See ../APP_STORE.md.
//
// Builds without signing (CI, scripts/test.sh) leave it empty and pass
// CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Automatic
